<title>CHINA: Erdos Cashmere approves cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Erdos Cashmere approves cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Inner Mongolia Erdos Cashmere Products Co have approved the firm's plan to issue a pre-tax cash dividend of 0.32 yuan per share based on 1996 net profits, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The dividend for B share holders will be exchanged at a rate of 8.2931 yuan to the U.S. dollar, the statement said. Ex-dividend date for B shares will be May 19.</p>
<p>The plan was proposed by the firm's board of directors last month, it said.</p>
</text>
